iu Bei from early on and later served as Governor of Shu Commandery and Secretary General, renowned for his quick wit and eloquence. In 229, when Sun Quan proclaimed himself Emperor, the matter provoked fierce debate within Shu-Han. Chen Zhen was sent as envoy and successfully concluded an altar oath with Sun Quan to divide the realm between them, formally acknowledging Sun Quan's imperial title and securing the alliance. For the next decade, Wu launched no military actions against Shu-Han, allowing Zhuge Liang to focus entirely on the Northern Expeditions.","jp":"蜀漢の官吏。早くから劉備に従い、後に蜀郡太守や尚書令などを歴任、機敏にして弁が立つことで知られた。229年、孫権の皇帝即位を巡り蜀漢の内部で大きな議論が巻き起こった際、陳震は使者として呉に赴き、孫権と共に壇に登って盟誓を交わし、天下を二分して孫権の帝位を認めることで同盟を強固なものとした。その後10年間にわたり、東呉が蜀漢に対して軍事行動を起こすことはなく、諸葛亮は北伐に専念することができた。","kr":"촉한의 관료. 일찍이 유비를 따랐으며, 훗날 촉군태수, 상서령 등을 역임하였고 기민함과 뛰어난 언변으로 이름을 떨쳤다. 229년 손권이 칭제하자 촉한 내부에서는 이를 두고 큰 논란이 일었다. 이에 진진이 명을 받들어 사신으로 가 손권과 함께 단에 올라 맹약을 맺고 천하를 나누었으며, 손권의 제위를 인정하여 동맹을 굳건히 다졌다. 이후 10년 동안 동오는 촉한에 대해 어떠한 군사 행동도 감행하지 않았고, 제갈량은 북벌에 온전히 전념할 수 있었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10366","remark":"","surname":"陈","surnameTc":"陳","surnameEn":"Chen","surnameJp":"陳","surnameKr":"진","surnameOther":"","name":"震","nameTc":"震","nameEn":"Zhen","nameJp":"震","nameKr":"진","nameOther":"","word":"孝起","wordTc":"孝起","wordEn":"Xiaoqi","wordJp":"孝起","wordKr":"효기","wordOther":"","icon":"陈震","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1003","gender":"0","rule":"46","force":"46","wise":"75","politics":"78","charm":"77","will":"81","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"11/11/11/11/11/68/20/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1003002;1003